      <activity id="e337bbd5-a303-55a8-a66d-9ffa4a66c12c" activityNameId="5f638cef-d706-5873-a426-a94552e3fc58" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sulphate pulp, unbleached, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sulphate pulp, unbleached, at plant
na;
Synonyms: kraft pulp, Kraftzellstoff; 
UUID: 36bb2a27-e9ad-3852-9f95-9eca37e21ba9
This module includes the production of unbleached sulphate pulp - including transports to the pulp mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and drying, energy production on-site, recovery cycles of chemicals and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a Swiss study (based on scandinavian conditions) and from the Swedish EPA used as European average data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern average technology.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total European market sulphate pulp production in 2000: 9297 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_36bb2a27-e9ad-3852-9f95-9eca37e21ba9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
